 function leaves the other copy's action at its prior, and defection then dominates.\n\nUnder the essay's rule, the other copy's observation is different, so this same function on a different input is a separate node that doesn't move with my choice. Working through the expected utilities with the other copy at prior r, sending the letter comes out ahead for every r, so the verdict holds across priors.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Under the essay's A-FDT, the other copy gets a different observation, so its action tracks a different input and my choice on this input shouldn't move it. On that strict reading, intervening on my own function leaves the other copy's action at its prior, and defection then dominates.\n\nUnder the essay's rule, the other copy's observation is different, so this same function on a different input is a separate node that doesn't move with my choice. Working through the expected utilities with the other copy at prior r, sending the letter comes out ahead for every r, so the verdict holds across priors.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10674,"completion_tokens":1085,"total_tokens":11759,"cost":0.064396,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.064396,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.042696,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0217},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":572,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}